// ***** REMI_QUESTIONS *****
// How are you feeling? [GOOD FEELING] Disabled for now
"remi.feeling.question": "How are you feeling?",
// 0 Hearts
"remi.feeling.answer.good.a": "I'm good. Thanks for asking. You?",
"remi.feeling.answer.good.b": "Feeling... generally good. Yeah. What about you?",
// 2 Hearts
"remi.feeling.answer.good.c": "I'm okay...#$b#I'm really okay. Not saying that 'cause I'm actually not or anything.$11",
"remi.feeling.answer.good.d": "Mmmm, neutral. Well, it's more good than bad, I guess.#$b#But yeah, mostly good.$11",
// 4 Hearts
"remi.feeling.answer.good.e": "I exist and it's going neat so far. Yup.",
"remi.feeling.answer.good.f": "Totally not stealing anything today. Nope.$11",
// 6 Hearts
"remi.feeling.answer.good.g": "Good now that you're here. How about you?$9",
"remi.feeling.answer.good.h": "Hehe, feeling pretty excited actually.$h#$b#Something good will happen, I can just smell it.$11",
// 8 Hearts
"remi.feeling.answer.good.i": "I'm just glad you're here. Your smells is reassuring to me, you know?",
"remi.feeling.answer.good.j": "Feeling pretty fantastic! Thanks for asking.$9",
// 10 Hearts
"remi.feeling.answer.good.k": "Pretty stoked now that you're back. What about you, buddy?$9",
"remi.feeling.answer.good.l": "Feeling like hugging you actually, if that's alright with you.$9",

// Raining
"remi.feeling.answer.rain.good.a": "It smells really good right now. That's what I'm feelin'.$11",
"remi.feeling.answer.rain.good.b": "Pretty happy, actually. I love the rain. Do you?$9",
"remi.feeling.answer.rain.good.c": "Feeling like doing nothing and smelling the air all day.$u",
"remi.feeling.answer.rain.good.d": "Rain is the best. It even masks that nasty human smell, which is great!$9",



// Questions by date
// SPRING
"remi.thoughts.question.spring.1": "Happy New Year!",
"remi.thoughts.answer.spring.1": "Hehe, Happy New Year!$9#$b#Smells like the world has gone through full circle.#$b#Although the seasons will repeat, it's still gonna be a whole new year, right?$11",

"remi.thoughts.question.spring.12": "Tomorrow's Egg Festival.",
"remi.thoughts.answer.spring.12": "Is that so?#$b#Well then, go out there and crush some kids in the Egg Hunt tomorrow. Fish and I will be rooting for ya from a distance.$11",

"remi.thoughts.question.spring.15": "Any thoughts?",
"remi.thoughts.answer.spring.15": "Salmon berries! And lots of 'em, too.$h#$b#You're not the only forager around, @. How about you and I go on a competition who gets to pick up the most berries?$12",

"remi.thoughts.question.spring.18": "How's Salmon Berry picking?",
"remi.thoughts.answer.spring.18": "I got about 150 berries on a good day.#$b#When you're an expert forager, numbers like those are easy. My average is 70 berries.$11#$b#So, how about you? How many berries you got this season?",

"remi.thoughts.question.spring.23": "Tomorrow's Flower Dance.",
"remi.thoughts.answer.spring.23": "Oh, really? You got someone to dance with yet?$11#$b#Fish and I won't be attending. Events with a lot of people are just not our thing.#$b#I do love flowers, though. Used to a have a garden full of 'em.$11",

// SUMMER
"remi.thoughts.question.summer.10": "Tomorrow's the Luau.",
"remi.thoughts.answer.summer.10": "Yeah, been smelling a lot of good summer harvests, too.#$b#So, what'chu planning to put in there?",

"remi.thoughts.question.summer.12": "Any thoughts?",
"remi.thoughts.answer.summer.12": "The beach smells extra salty. I can smell it from all the way over here.$6#$b#Dunno what's going on but maybe you should check it out.",

"remi.thoughts.question.summer.15": "Any thoughts?",
"remi.thoughts.answer.summer.15": "Whoo! The beach doesn't smell too much anymore.$h#$b#Honestly, it was making me nervous. I kept thinking I'm next to the ocean or something.$6",

"remi.thoughts.question.summer.28": "Tonight's Dance of the Moonlight Jellies",
"remi.thoughts.answer.summer.28": "Ooh boy, I'm sure jelly of ya.$11#$b#Just kidding. I'm planning to stay far and away from the ocean anyways.#$b#You go enjoy the night.",

// FALL
"remi.thoughts.question.fall.8": "Any thoughts?",
"remi.thoughts.answer.fall.8": "It's Blackberry season!$h#$b#Part two of this year's foraging contest. You up for it?$12",

"remi.thoughts.question.fall.11": "How's Blackberry picking?",
"remi.thoughts.answer.fall.11": "...Not good.$6#$b#Eeehhh, some days you just get unlucky.$7",

"remi.thoughts.question.fall.15": "Tomorrow's the Stardew Valley Fair.",
"remi.thoughts.answer.fall.15": "Too many people and games require vision. No thank you.$11#$b#You go on ahead and have fun tomorrow. Fish and I will be here the whole day.",

"remi.thoughts.question.fall.27": "Today's Spirit's Eve",
"remi.thoughts.answer.fall.27": "Sounds fun. But you know the drill. We ain't going.#$b#I'm sure the food Chef Gus will prepare will be great though. The air smells like bountiful harvest.$11",

// WINTER
"remi.thoughts.question.winter.7": "Tomorrow's Festival of Ice",
"remi.thoughts.answer.winter.7": "In that case, fishing contest. That's the main event of the er... event.#$b#Oarfish can catch fish by just desiring them to come to her.#$b#So, good thing she doesn't attend festivals, huh?$11",

"remi.thoughts.question.winter.24": "Tomorrow's Feast of the Winter Star",
"remi.thoughts.answer.winter.24": "Gift exchange, then? Hope you get a good one.#$b#Well, can't expect much from humans, but make sure to come back tomorrow. I'll have something good for ya.$11",






// Questions Random before marriage
"remi.thoughts.question.random": "Any thoughts?",

// Spring
"remi.thoughts.answer.spring.a": "Spring, spring, spring...$11#$b#Everything springs right back up right after the snow melts away. I just love the concept of it.",
"remi.thoughts.answer.spring.b": "Everything smells like pink.#$b#And green... yeah, green.$11",
"remi.thoughts.answer.spring.c": "Hmm, thoughts, thoughts...$6#$b#Sorry, I got nothing right now.",
"remi.thoughts.answer.spring.d": "Let's see...#$b#I'm thinking about how good the grass smells this season.$11",
"remi.thoughts.answer.spring.e": "Hmmmmmm.....$6#$b#My mom comes to mind.",
"remi.thoughts.answer.spring.rain.a": "It smells really good right now. That's what I'm thinkin'.$11",
"remi.thoughts.answer.spring.rain.b": "Rain in the spring smells fresh, no? It's really refreshing.$11",

// Summer
"remi.thoughts.answer.summer.a": "Urrmmm... it's too hot to think of anything else.$6",
"remi.thoughts.answer.summer.b": "Hmmm, I remember not moving for an entire season. Until you found me, that is.",
"remi.thoughts.answer.summer.c": "Ehhh... everything smells like baked corn...#$b#Which is not that bad.$11",
"remi.thoughts.answer.summer.d": "Thinking about ice cream. You got cows on your farm?",
"remi.thoughts.answer.summer.e": "Ehh... looking forward to getting a cold drink, I guess.",
"remi.thoughts.answer.summer.rain.a": "Aaah, summer rain. The best feeling in the world!$h",
"remi.thoughts.answer.summer.rain.b": "Don't you just love it, when the dryness of the earth gets wet and oozes out that wonderful petrichor smell?$11",

// Fall
"remi.thoughts.answer.fall.a": "Fall, fall, fall...$11#$b#Fall asleep and hibernate until spring.$11#$b#Sounds nice. But if I'm not careful, I might be asleep for years and I wouldn't know.",
"remi.thoughts.answer.fall.b": "Hmmm, this season is making me sleepy.$11#$b#Can't really tell if I'm awake or dreaming sometimes...$6",
"remi.thoughts.answer.fall.c": "Everything smells orange, red, and gold. Yup.#$b#With a dash of purple, too.$11",
"remi.thoughts.answer.fall.d": "I think I might go for fancy wine this season. The air just smells right for it.$11",
"remi.thoughts.answer.fall.e": "Things crunch under my feet when I walk sometimes.#$b#Just hoping those things weren't alive at that point.$6",
"remi.thoughts.answer.fall.rain.a": "Feeling like doing nothing and smelling the air all day.$u",
"remi.thoughts.answer.fall.rain.b": "Mmmm... the smell of golden rain.$11#$b#Wait, no. That's bad.$6",

// Winter
"remi.thoughts.answer.winter.a": "Everything smells blue.#$b#And white... yeah, white.$11",
"remi.thoughts.answer.winter.b": "My fingers are getting numb.$6",
"remi.thoughts.answer.winter.c": "Ah...!$8#$b#AAACHOO!!$13#$b#*sniffle*, sorry.$6",
"remi.thoughts.answer.winter.d": "Kinda hard to walk around this season. Snow every step of the way.$6",
"remi.thoughts.answer.winter.e": "Thinking about making hot soup. You in?",
"remi.thoughts.answer.winter.rain.a": "Does it even rain in winter? Oh well.",
"remi.thoughts.answer.winter.rain.b": "This is impossible weather, right?$6",

// NON-SEASON SPECIFIC
"remi.thoughts.answer.a": "I'm wondering if you know anything about braille.#$b#Although, I guess it's easier to just ask Oarfish to write for me. I'm really lazy and all that.$11",
"remi.thoughts.answer.b": "Hmm...$6#$b#My friend from back home comes to mind.",
"remi.thoughts.answer.c": "Let's see...$11#$b#Oh, don't give Oarfish any kind of vegetable. She hates those.$6",
"remi.thoughts.answer.d": "If any sort of event is going on in town, you bet we're not going.$11",
"remi.thoughts.answer.e": "You smell more than usual.#$b#I mean, you smell more like the life you grow. You know, like soil and animals?$11#$b#It's not a bad scent.",
"remi.thoughts.answer.f": "Thinking about tempura. I'm already missing that good crunch.$11#$b#Say, how about a seafood boil party? Fish would love it.",
"remi.thoughts.answer.g": "I'm not into that trash cola. Even I have standards.$6#$b#You can give those to Fish, though. She loves those sugar bombs.$11",
"remi.thoughts.answer.h": "You haven't seen any other weird space aliens have you?$6#$b#Report them to us. Most of the time they're fugitives from where we came from.#$b#Haha! And I'm saying that being a fugitive myself!$h#$b#But seriously, Fish is an officer back home, so report about it when you see a weirdo like us, alright?$9",
"remi.thoughts.answer.i": "Sometimes, I can smell that bittersweet orange peel on my nose.$11#$b#Mwehehehe...$u#$b#*slurp* sorry. I was drooling.$6",
"remi.thoughts.answer.j": "Human cuisine is a worthwhile hobby. Especially when you can grow your own ingredients or pick them fresh from the wild.#$b#Have you been cooking, @? I'd love to be your taste tester.$9",









